---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const breadcrumbs = [{ name: 'Home', item: 'https://tyrelink.lk/' }, { name: 'Our story', item: 'https://tyrelink.lk/about' }];
---
<Layout title="Our story | TyreLink, Walasmulla" description="Meet TyreLink: a Sri Lankan tyre, tube and vehicle accessory business with roots in CIN Distributors, established in 1994." breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>
  <div class="tl-container">
    <section class="tl-section tl-split">
      <div>
        <p class="tl-eyebrow">Our story · Since 1994</p>
        <h1 class="tl-title">Good journeys<br />start with trust.</h1>
        <p class="tl-copy">The right tyre. A helpful conversation. The confidence to get on with your day. That is what we want every visit to TyreLink to feel like.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-panel story-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 600 440" fill="none"><path d="M-60 440C40 140 510 360 660-20M-30 470C70 170 540 390 690 10M0 500C100 200 570 420 720 40" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="300" cy="210" r="106" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="300" cy="210" r="72" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"/><circle cx="300" cy="210" r="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M300 138V196M300 224V282M228 210H286M314 210H372M249 159L290 200M310 220L351 261M249 261L290 220M310 200L351 159" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
        <span>Built around the road ahead.</span>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="tl-section tl-split story-rule">
      <div><p class="tl-eyebrow">Our foundations</p><h2 class="tl-title">Local roots.<br />Lasting relationships.</h2></div>
      <div class="story-prose"><p class="tl-copy">Our story began with CIN Distributors in 1994, supplying tyres and tubes to our community. Today, TyreLink brings that experience together with vehicle accessories and workshop essentials.</p><p class="tl-copy">From our base in Walasmulla, we help everyday drivers and trade customers find what they need. This online store makes it easier to explore the range, ask a question and arrange your order with our team.</p><a class="tl-button-secondary" href="/contact">Meet us in Walasmulla ↗</a></div>
    </section>
    <section class="tl-section">
      <p class="tl-eyebrow">The TyreLink approach</p><h2 class="tl-title">More care. Less guesswork.</h2>
      <div class="tl-grid">
        <article class="tl-panel"><p class="tl-eyebrow">01 / Choose with confidence</p><h3>Advice that makes sense.</h3><p class="tl-copy">Tell us your tyre size, vehicle and everyday driving needs. We will help you check the options before you order.</p></article>
        <article class="tl-panel"><p class="tl-eyebrow">02 / Know what you are buying</p><h3>Details before decisions.</h3><p class="tl-copy">Confirm the current price, availability and DOT manufacture date with our team.</p></article>
        <article class="tl-panel"><p class="tl-eyebrow">03 / Keep things personal</p><h3>A real conversation.</h3><p class="tl-copy">Contact us directly for product questions, collection arrangements or delivery information. No customer account needed.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="tl-section tl-split story-rule">
      <div><p class="tl-eyebrow">People behind the business</p><h2>Led by Champika Agalakada.</h2><p class="tl-copy">TyreLink is built on the relationships between our team, our suppliers and the customers who return to us. Our owner, Champika Agalakada, is part of that continuing story.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-panel"><p class="tl-eyebrow">Your next journey</p><h2>Let us help you find your fit.</h2><p class="tl-copy">Explore the collection or speak with someone who can help.</p><a class="tl-button" href="/shop">Explore the collection ↗</a></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
<style>
.story-art{position:relative;min-height:360px;display:grid;align-content:center;overflow:hidden;color:var(--tl-muted,#77756e)}.story-art svg{width:100%;height:auto}.story-art span{padding:0 1rem 1rem;font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}.story-rule{border-top:1px solid var(--tl-line,#ddd9d0)}.story-prose{display:grid;gap:1.5rem}.tl-panel h3{font-size:1.5rem;margin:1rem 0}.tl-panel .tl-copy{margin-bottom:1.5rem}h2:not(.tl-title){font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.5rem);line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
</style>
